Changes in version 0.99.0

* Convert analysis into a native R package without a workflow engine.
* Return GRanges regions and RangedSummarizedExperiment locus results.
* Keep alignment ranges and footprint GRangesLists in colData so read subsets
  remain synchronized with the sparse modification assay.
* Support explicit optional Leiden clustering and plant transcript annotations.
* Warn when a supplied footprint track has no calls in a selected region.
* Add an executable ALAS1 vignette comparing both clustering choices.
